---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Links"
description: "Projects and communities we trust and recommend, grouped by what they're for."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h1>Webring &amp; recommendations</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="lede">
    People and projects doing work we trust or have learned from. We link out on purpose — if something here fits your need better than we do, go use theirs. Suggest an addition on the <a href="/get-involved/">Get Involved</a> page.
  </p>

  {% for category, items in links %}
  <div class="link-category">
    <h3>{{ category }}</h3>
    <div class="link-grid">
      {% for item in items %}
      <div class="link-card">
        <a href="{{ item.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ item.name }}</a>
        <p>{{ item.note }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
